t=3D"text">Build the card feature so it has two clearly separated modes:</p=
><p class=3D"TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow=3D"" data-d-comp=
onent=3D"text"><span class=3D"TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow=
=3D"" data-d-component=3D"text" data-d-default-strong=3D"" data-d-inline=3D=
"">Demo Mode:</span> Users can add fictional SNAP, WIC, and TANF cards, see=
 balances, switch cards, and simulate checkout. This can be developed and t=
ested immediately.</p><p class=3D"TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-=
flow=3D"" data-d-component=3D"text"><span class=3D"TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nub=
