=3D"" data-d-inline=3D"">Authorized Live Mode:</span> Once BronzeManna has =
agreements with issuers or processors, users can securely link eligible acc=
ounts. Actual payment functions become available only for programs and stat=
es where BronzeManna has the necessary authorization.</p><p class=3D"TextBa=
se-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow=3D"" data-d-component=3D"text">This=
