M5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-text-flow=3D"" data-d-component=3D"text" data-d-d=
efault-strong=3D"" data-d-inline=3D"">completely independent wallet where p=
eople tap their phones to pay directly inside your app</span>, or would you=
 be comfortable with BronzeManna securely adding eligible cards to Apple Wa=
llet and Google Wallet?</p><p class=3D"TextBase-qM5iDq Text-nubxrT" data-d-=
text-flow=3D"" data-d-component=3D"text">Both are worth exploring, but they=
 require different technical architectures and partnerships.</p></div></div=
